shooting.mdx","Resolución de problemas de despliegue","Diagnostica acceso, salud de los servicios y dependencias de infraestructura.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/deployment/troubleshooting",{"_97":531},"deployment/troubleshooting.mdx",{"_72":533,"_79":118,"_93":-7,"_74":16},"es:_14",{"_72":535,"_79":90,"_74":536,"_84":537,"_93":-7,"_11":12,"_95":538},"es:deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx","Despliega desde AWS Marketplace","Ejecuta una instancia preconfigurada de Lamassu IoT en Amazon EC2.",{"_97":539},"deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx",{"_72":541,"_79":90,"_74":542,"_84":543,"_93":-7,"_11":544,"_95":545},"es:deployment/saas.mdx","Utiliza Lamassu como SaaS","Consume Lamassu como servicio gestionado sin operar infraestructura propia.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/deployment/saas",{"_97":546},"deployment/saas.mdx","es:deployment",{"_232":549},"deployment/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/images/kubernetes.svg\"/><img src=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/images/kubernetes.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;vertical-align:middle;flex-shrink:0;object-fit:contain\"/>",{"_79":80,"_74":552,"_82":28,"_83":-7,"_84":553,"_86":-7,"_76":554,"_72":562,"_95":563,"_93":565},"Actualizaciones","Guía de versión a versión para el operador",[555],{"_72":556,"_79":90,"_74":557,"_84":558,"_93":-7,"_11":559,"_95":560},"es:upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","3.8.0 a 4.0.0","Qué cambia en la arquitectura de 4.0.0, qué cambios rompen un despliegue 3.8.0, cómo actualizar paso a paso una release de Helm y cómo validar el resultado.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0",{"_97":561},"upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","es:upgrades",{"_232":564},"upgrades/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-arrow-up shrink-0 text-[#c8861f]\" aria-hidd